1
00:00:43,252 --> 00:00:46,533
=Born Again=

2
00:00:46,533 --> 00:00:49,526
=Episode 2=

3
00:00:52,123 --> 00:00:53,640
(Two Hours Before the Wedding)

4
00:00:53,640 --> 00:00:54,763
(This is...)

5
00:00:56,040 --> 00:00:57,120
(Why am I back again?)

6
00:00:57,960 --> 00:00:59,027
(Why?)

7
00:01:00,855 --> 00:01:01,998
(Why is that?)

8
00:01:09,640 --> 00:01:10,680
(This is the third time.)

9
00:01:11,040 --> 00:01:12,320
What is going on?

10
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:14,160
He...

11
00:01:14,160 --> 00:01:15,283
Gu Xiaotang.

12
00:01:15,520 --> 00:01:16,840
Stay put in the next loop.

13
00:01:17,560 --> 00:01:18,575
I'll come to you.

14
00:01:18,760 --> 00:01:20,160
(How does he know about the loop?)

15
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:22,390
Who is he?

16
00:01:28,760 --> 00:01:29,960
- Happy...
- Move!

17
00:01:31,560 --> 00:01:33,184
Hello, police?

18
00:01:33,184 --> 00:01:34,200
I'm stuck in the loop.

19
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:35,360
- Loop?
- Xiaotang.

20
00:01:37,560 --> 00:01:39,880
Xiaotang, you can't file
a false police report.

21
00:01:39,880 --> 00:01:41,280
Is it hypoglycemia again?

22
00:01:41,280 --> 00:01:42,320
Are you hallucinating?

23
00:01:42,320 --> 00:01:44,000
How about I go get you some sugar?

24
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:45,480
(Sign-in)
This is the wedding cake.

25
00:01:48,720 --> 00:01:50,480
(Everyone knows
I'm allergic to peanuts.)

26
00:01:51,240 --> 00:01:53,000
(Why were there peanuts in the cake?)

27
00:01:57,240 --> 00:01:59,480
Xiaotang, where are you going?

28
00:02:23,160 --> 00:02:24,292
Director Li,

29
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:27,400
you like to spice things up?

30
00:02:27,400 --> 00:02:28,440
Let me spice you up.

31
00:02:29,160 --> 00:02:30,330
Is it enough?

32
00:02:31,920 --> 00:02:33,280
You knew I'm allergic to peanuts,

33
00:02:33,640 --> 00:02:34,800
yet you put it in the cake.

34
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:36,160
Are you trying to kill me?

35
00:02:46,560 --> 00:02:47,560
Kill you?

36
00:02:48,240 --> 00:02:50,240
Xiaotang, I'm just helping you.

37
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:51,840
An influencer's wedding

38
00:02:51,840 --> 00:02:54,040
can't be without a little drama.

39
00:02:55,040 --> 00:02:56,040
Die!

40
00:03:06,280 --> 00:03:08,200
A tiny bit of peanut powder
can kill you?

41
00:03:08,480 --> 00:03:09,880
I find it hard to believe.

42
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:20,038
(Oh no.)

43
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:22,400
How about I test it out?

44
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:24,815
(Is everything)

45
00:03:26,080 --> 00:03:27,160
(gonna start over again?)

46
00:03:44,880 --> 00:03:46,105
Don't move.

47
00:03:56,931 --> 00:04:00,373
♪The face deep in the heart♪

48
00:04:00,430 --> 00:04:02,991
♪Suddenly clear and hazy♪

49
00:04:04,274 --> 00:04:08,004
♪Across time and space, eyes meet again♪

50
00:04:08,217 --> 00:04:10,607
♪Deeply trapped in the vortex♪

51
00:04:10,793 --> 00:04:13,341
♪Searching for familiar outlines♪

52
00:04:14,600 --> 00:04:15,680
Who are you?

53
00:04:15,680 --> 00:04:16,840
How dare you meddle in here?

54
00:04:16,840 --> 00:04:18,080
Watch out!

55
00:04:34,520 --> 00:04:36,520
It's okay, you're safe now.

56
00:04:48,440 --> 00:04:49,567
Get lost.

57
00:04:52,640 --> 00:04:53,760
What's going on?

58
00:04:53,760 --> 00:04:55,120
Who's this guy?

59
00:04:58,960 --> 00:05:00,200
Didn't I tell you

60
00:05:00,200 --> 00:05:01,249
to stay put

61
00:05:01,440 --> 00:05:02,552
and wait for me?

62
00:05:06,640 --> 00:05:07,680
I'll get you out of here.

63
00:05:25,640 --> 00:05:27,080
The wound on the left hasn't healed.

64
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:28,801
Don't do strenuous activity.

65
00:05:29,400 --> 00:05:30,880
(How does he know about my wound?)

66
00:05:31,880 --> 00:05:32,884
Here.

67
00:05:33,160 --> 00:05:34,360
You have hypoglycemia, right?

68
00:05:36,360 --> 00:05:38,040
H-How did you know?

69
00:05:38,480 --> 00:05:40,200
I don't know you. Who are you?

70
00:05:40,400 --> 00:05:41,423
That's not important.

71
00:05:42,240 --> 00:05:43,400
What's important is,

72
00:05:43,400 --> 00:05:45,120
like you, I'm also trapped in today.

73
00:05:45,720 --> 00:05:47,600
This is already the third loop,

74
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:48,690
right?

75
00:05:50,400 --> 00:05:51,600
How do you know all this?

76
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:52,720
You can't go back,

77
00:05:52,720 --> 00:05:54,120
or you'll enter the loop again.

78
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:55,560
Come with me. We can...

79
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:56,578
Why should I trust you?

80
00:05:58,840 --> 00:06:00,080
In this world,

81
00:06:00,080 --> 00:06:01,520
there's no one I can trust anymore.

82
00:06:02,080 --> 00:06:03,960
And I didn't get
my contract termination fee.

83
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:05,600
I'm one step away from freedom.

84
00:06:06,120 --> 00:06:07,383
I'm not going with you.

85
00:06:08,360 --> 00:06:09,467
It's useless.

86
00:06:10,200 --> 00:06:11,280
Unless you break the loop,

87
00:06:12,280 --> 00:06:13,760
you'll never get that money.

88
00:06:30,080 --> 00:06:31,880
Miss Gu, the wedding is about to start.

89
00:06:31,880 --> 00:06:32,920
Where are you going?

90
00:06:32,920 --> 00:06:34,080
Gu Xiaotang,

91
00:06:34,280 --> 00:06:35,440
I've paid you.

92
00:06:35,440 --> 00:06:36,520
Give me the negatives.

93
00:06:36,520 --> 00:06:38,280
Get lost. I don't have time for you.

94
00:06:39,480 --> 00:06:41,360
Gu Xiaotang, you can't leave.

95
00:06:41,960 --> 00:06:43,090
What's going on?

96
00:06:47,880 --> 00:06:48,925
Mom.

97
00:06:56,520 --> 00:06:57,721
Xiaotang,

98
00:06:58,480 --> 00:06:59,840
I apologize on his behalf.

99
00:07:00,280 --> 00:07:01,600
We can cancel the wedding,

100
00:07:03,080 --> 00:07:04,198
but

101
00:07:04,280 --> 00:07:05,480
can you give

102
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:06,688
these photos to me?

103
00:07:06,760 --> 00:07:08,200
If these photos get out,

104
00:07:08,520 --> 00:07:10,320
Lu Group's stock price will plummet,

105
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:13,592
and thousands of employees
will be affected.

106
00:07:14,080 --> 00:07:16,120
They are all innocent.

107
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:35,600
Is watching drama

108
00:07:35,600 --> 00:07:36,640
really that entertaining?

109
00:07:41,920 --> 00:07:44,640
You'll receive the compensation
you deserve.

110
00:07:44,640 --> 00:07:46,200
But Xiaotang,

111
00:07:46,200 --> 00:07:47,400
I would like

112
00:07:49,240 --> 00:07:51,200
to borrow something else from you.

113
00:07:54,600 --> 00:07:56,600
What are you doing? Let go of me!

114
00:07:56,600 --> 00:07:57,640
- Let go of me!
- Move!

115
00:08:29,040 --> 00:08:30,093
What...

116
00:08:30,400 --> 00:08:31,480
What is this?

117
00:08:31,480 --> 00:08:32,520
Xiaotang,

118
00:08:32,520 --> 00:08:33,524
don't be afraid.

119
00:08:33,680 --> 00:08:35,280
It will end soon.

120
00:08:35,280 --> 00:08:36,400
What do you mean?

121
00:08:37,080 --> 00:08:38,109
Xiaotang,

122
00:08:40,160 --> 00:08:42,662
we need one of your kidneys.

123
00:08:48,760 --> 00:08:49,811
You...

124
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:51,440
This is illegal.

125
00:08:51,760 --> 00:08:53,480
- Let go of me!
- Illegal?

126
00:08:53,680 --> 00:08:54,680
Xiaotang,

127
00:08:54,680 --> 00:08:55,800
did you forget?

128
00:08:55,800 --> 00:08:57,680
After the premarital health checkup,

129
00:08:57,680 --> 00:08:59,680
out of your love for Qingyuan

130
00:08:59,680 --> 00:09:01,520
and filial piety toward me,

131
00:09:02,080 --> 00:09:03,560
you voluntarily signed

132
00:09:03,560 --> 00:09:05,480
the organ donation consent form.

133
00:09:05,480 --> 00:09:07,160
You forced me to sign that.

134
00:09:07,160 --> 00:09:08,440
Xiaotang,

135
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:10,000
saving your mother-in-law

136
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:11,320
is only right and proper.

137
00:09:11,880 --> 00:09:13,760
I will remember your kindness.

138
00:09:15,640 --> 00:09:17,080
Mom, let's go.

139
00:09:21,800 --> 00:09:23,400
To the outside world,

140
00:09:23,400 --> 00:09:25,800
you just suddenly fell ill

141
00:09:25,800 --> 00:09:28,120
and passed away
despite emergency treatment.

142
00:09:28,120 --> 00:09:31,720
Look, this is good for everyone.

143
00:09:53,200 --> 00:09:54,353
Do it.

144
00:09:55,680 --> 00:09:56,747
Mr. Lu,

145
00:09:56,960 --> 00:09:58,600
the anesthesia hasn't taken effect yet,

146
00:09:59,160 --> 00:10:00,560
and she's still conscious.

147
00:10:00,560 --> 00:10:01,621
This...

148
00:10:05,800 --> 00:10:07,920
Watching herself being cut open,

149
00:10:11,800 --> 00:10:12,960
isn't that more interesting?

150
00:10:45,098 --> 00:10:46,134
What's going on?

151
00:10:46,134 --> 00:10:47,800
- Why are the lights out?
- Turn them on!

152
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:52,120
Mr. Lu, something's wrong!

153
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:53,520
The power is out on this floor.

154
00:10:53,520 --> 00:10:55,040
- Any backup generator?
- I don't know.

155
00:10:55,336 --> 00:10:56,360
Darn it.

156
00:10:56,360 --> 00:10:57,640
Where's the maintenance team?

157
00:10:58,680 --> 00:10:59,750
Mr. Lu, something's wrong!

158
00:10:59,920 --> 00:11:01,640
The power suddenly went out.
The scalpel...

159
00:11:01,640 --> 00:11:03,120
We accidentally injured Mrs. Lu.

160
00:11:03,120 --> 00:11:05,200
She's bleeding out
and her condition is critical.

161
00:11:05,480 --> 00:11:06,680
Mom. Hurry!

162
00:11:06,680 --> 00:11:07,808
Save my mom first!

163
00:11:09,280 --> 00:11:10,520
Where's my mom? Where is she?

164
00:11:10,520 --> 00:11:11,640
In that operating room.

165
00:11:17,181 --> 00:11:18,250
Who are you?

166
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:30,530
Stop him!

167
00:12:17,480 --> 00:12:18,624
Gu Xiaotang.

168
00:12:22,800 --> 00:12:24,160
- You...
- My...

169
00:12:24,160 --> 00:12:25,421
My name is Ye Shen.

170
00:12:25,840 --> 00:12:27,142
Ye Shen?

171
00:12:29,040 --> 00:12:30,059
Don't be afraid.

172
00:12:30,280 --> 00:12:31,280
I'll get you out of here.

173
00:12:34,409 --> 00:12:36,286
(Please wait outside the operating room)

174
00:12:44,960 --> 00:12:46,048
Ye Shen.

175
00:12:46,048 --> 00:12:47,240
(Countdown to Death)

176
00:12:47,240 --> 00:12:48,360
I'm so sleepy.

177
00:12:49,160 --> 00:12:50,184
Go to sleep.

178
00:12:51,120 --> 00:12:52,400
I'll always stay by your side.

179
00:13:09,880 --> 00:13:10,961
Ye Shen.

180
00:13:15,075 --> 00:13:19,714
(Two Hours Before the Wedding)

181
00:13:54,010 --> 00:13:57,366
♪The face deep in the heart♪

182
00:13:57,558 --> 00:14:00,020
♪Suddenly clear and hazy♪

183
00:14:01,395 --> 00:14:05,095
♪Across time and space, eyes meet again♪

184
00:14:05,306 --> 00:14:07,746
♪Deeply trapped in the vortex♪

185
00:14:07,893 --> 00:14:10,265
♪Searching for familiar outlines♪

186
00:14:10,415 --> 00:14:13,172
♪Persistently guarding,
endlessly cycling♪

187
00:14:13,172 --> 00:14:15,493
♪Even for just a second♪

188
00:14:16,838 --> 00:14:20,301
♪If raindrops flow backward
into the sky♪

189
00:14:20,429 --> 00:14:22,278
♪And sunlight reverses♪

190
00:14:22,278 --> 00:14:25,748
♪As the sun rises and sets,
we reunite with yesterday♪

191
00:14:26,104 --> 00:14:28,178
♪I'll build a dream with you♪

192
00:14:28,680 --> 00:14:32,089
♪Upon the ruins, spring breeze arrives♪

193
00:14:32,346 --> 00:14:37,558
♪Even if there's no end,
I won't regret the start♪

194
00:14:38,812 --> 00:14:41,377
♪Eternity like a day, rushing to you♪

195
00:14:41,419 --> 00:14:44,872
♪You don't need to recognize my eyes♪

196
00:14:45,449 --> 00:14:48,412
♪Following the tracks
of the days that were♪

197
00:14:49,157 --> 00:14:51,765
♪A day like a lifetime, rushing to you♪

198
00:14:51,765 --> 00:14:55,388
♪You don't need to remember my name♪

199
00:14:55,858 --> 00:14:59,914
♪I'll be the dawn you haven't seen♪
